Description:  SCP-5188 is a cryptocurrency called , developed by a start-up company of the same name. SCP-5188 can be used to create geas pacts by making financial transactions, with the relation between the money exchanged and the anomalous conditions of the geas being based on the desires of all involved in the transaction. These anomalous conditions can be memetic, psionic, and conceptual bindings.

Addendum 1:  Development

SCP-5188 was developed around the proposal of ICSUT student Adam Peterson (POI-████), who proposed the development of an independent currency for use by inhabitants of free-ports. Bellow is the paper in which the EU-G project was proposed:




Economic Independence: A Proposal

~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

Free ports, in the majority of cases, rely on currencies from Earth. This creates a reliance on Earth-bound economic institutions and poses a potential information security risk based on transaction histories. I have been making plans on developing a cryptocurrency designed for use by inhabitants of free-ports.

This currency will be given special anomalous properties through conceptual engineering. These properties allow users to automatically establish geas contracts, simply by making a transaction.





